# --- NVIDIA GPU support (driver installed on demand: `mark42-nvidia`) ---
# The proprietary driver is NOT baked in: Debian's current nvidia 550 does not
# compile against kernel 6.12.113. The desktop runs on the Intel/AMD iGPU, and
# `mark42-nvidia` installs + signs the driver on the real machine when wanted.
# nouveau (open driver) drives the discrete GPU until then.
firmware-nvidia-gsp
switcheroo-control
mokutil
openssl
libnotify-bin
git
curl
ca-certificates
gnupg
wget
nano
vim
htop
btop
fastfetch
zip
unzip
p7zip-full

